WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.808
[EPIC MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:07.360
 When we set out
to make Eternals,

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:10.570
the word "immersion"
was everything.

00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:13.810
In IMAX, especially with
the extended aspect ratio,

00:00:13.810 --> 00:00:15.970
it gives so much more.

00:00:15.970 --> 00:00:18.250
The reason why E.A.R
particularly worked well

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:20.830
with Eternals is
that we're constantly

00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:23.830
seeing our characters,
which is human size,

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:28.240
interacting with Celestials that
are 10 times the size of Earth.

00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:30.310
So it's actually
a tool to immerse

00:00:30.310 --> 00:00:33.190
the audience in the
experience of our characters.

00:00:33.190 --> 00:00:36.580
IMAX just find that perfect
balance, the mythology

00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:39.640
of the Celestials,
the origin of the MCU,

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:41.980
in the most glorious format.

00:00:41.980 --> 00:00:43.780
[RUMBLING ECHOES]

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:49.830
[CELESTIAL PING]

